Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:32.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Ichiji?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:34.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Kaçsana Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.39,0:10:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven abi! Sen iyi misin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.11,0:10:52.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Sırtındakini bırak!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:54.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Kara Bacak!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.41,0:10:56.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Yine yeri öpeceksin-{\i1}yu{\i0}!
